          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"About {{THERAPIST_NAME}} — private therapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Compassionate care for anxiety, trauma, relationships, and life transitions.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0b1220;--fg:#f7f7f8;--accent:#ffd8b5;--muted:#bfc7d0;--card:#0f1724}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#07101a);color:var(--fg);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    .container{max-width:980px;margin:48px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:15px}\\n    h1{font-size:36px;margin:8px 0 0}\\n    .strap{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:32px;align-items:start;margin-top:28px}\\n    .lead{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,216,181,0.06), transparent);padding:24px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .avatar{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}\\n    .avatar svg{width:100%;height:auto}\\n    .card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:18px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .testimonials{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#0b1220;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;margin-top:18px}\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .leadmag{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}\\n    .leadmag input{flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);background:transparent;color:var(--fg)}\\n    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"strap\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Fees</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Welcome — a quieter, clearer place to think</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">I\\u2019m {{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} offering confidential psychotherapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. My work centers on respectful curiosity, practical tools, and steady presence.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"lead\\\">\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">How I support people</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">I blend evidence-informed techniques with a relational, whole-person focus. Typical areas I work with include anxiety, complex grief, life transitions, relationship strain, and burnout recovery.</p>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <a style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline\\\" href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">View specialties →</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">A few ways people describe working together</h3>\\n          <ul class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:12px 0 0;padding-left:18px\\\">\\n            <li>Practical strategies that fit daily life</li>\\n            <li>Safer exploration of painful memories</li>\\n            <li>Clearer boundaries and relational confidence</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Confidentiality & scope</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Sessions are private. I will explain limits to confidentiality (e.g., safety concerns, mandatory reporting) before we begin. I do not provide emergency services; if you are in crisis, call local emergency services or a crisis line.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n        <!-- Unique inline avatar SVG for about page -->\\n        <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Profile illustration\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffd8b5\\\" />\\n              <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffb199\\\" />\\n            </linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" rx=\\\"16\\\" fill=\\\"#071422\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"100\\\" cy=\\\"74\\\" r=\\\"34\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n          <rect x=\\\"40\\\" y=\\\"120\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"48\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"#0d2633\\\" />\\n          <path d=\\\"M60 140c8 6 32 6 80 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#2da0b7\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">What others have said</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"testimonials\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"Clear, calm guidance\\\"</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">I left sessions with steps to practice and with less shame about my past. — client in {{CITY}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"Gentle but direct\\\"</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Therapy helped me set healthier boundaries without feeling guilty. — client</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"leadmag\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Free guide: Making small changes that last</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A short workbook with reflection prompts and simple practices you can try between sessions.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"get\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px\\\">\\n        <input name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email address\\\" aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\" required>\\n        <button class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get the guide</button>\\n      </form>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:28px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Ready to begin?</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">I offer time-limited work and ongoing therapy, and I\\u2019m happy to clarify options in a brief consultation.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{THERAPIST_NAME}} — {{LICENSE}} • {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"disclaimer\\\">Confidentiality note: Sessions are confidential except where disclosure is required by law. This site is for informational purposes and does not replace individualized clinical evaluation. If you are experiencing an emergency, call local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"specialties.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Specialties — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Therapeutic specialties offered by {{THERAPIST_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Anxiety, trauma-informed care, relationships, grief, and transitions.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--fg:#07202a;--accent:#2d6a7a;--muted:#6b7b82;--card:#f6fbfc}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:14px}\\n    h1{font-size:34px;margin:6px 0}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:28px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .list{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    .spec{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .tag{display:inline-block;background:#eaf6f8;color:var(--accent);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px}\\n    .price-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-note\\\">Real support. Practical tools.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Specialties</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Methods</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"fees.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <section>\\n        <h1>Paths of focus</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"price-note\\\">I offer focused short-term pathways and open-ended therapy depending on need. Below are common areas I work with and what to expect.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"list\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div class=\\\"tag\\\">Anxiety</div>\\n                <h3 style=\\\"margin:8px 0 6px\\\">Managing worry without numbing out</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"price-note\\\">CBT-informed approaches, mindfulness skills, and behavioral experiments to reduce avoidance and increase tolerance.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Focused Pathway</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"price-note\\\">6-12 sessions</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div class=\\\"tag\\\">Trauma-informed care</div>\\n                <h3 style=\\\"margin:8px 0 6px\\\">Safety, pacing, and integration</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"price-note\\\">Gentle trauma work that centers stabilization, nervous system regulation, and gradual processing when appropriate.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Stabilization & processing</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"price-note\\\">Tailored timing</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div class=\\\"tag\\\">Relationships</div>\\n                <h3 style=\\\"margin:8px 0 6px\\\">Communication, repair, and boundaries</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"price-note\\\">Work for individuals and couples focused on clearer communication, attachment patterns, and repair skills.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Relationship Support</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"price-note\\\">Short-term work or ongoing</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div class=\\\"tag\\\">Life transitions & grief</div>\\n                <h3 style=\\\"margin:8px 0 6px\\\">Meaningful change with steady support</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"price-note\\\">Practical planning, values-aligned decisions, and compassionate processing of loss and transition.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Adaptive Support</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"price-note\\\">4-16 sessions</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <div class=\\\"tag\\\">Burnout & work stress</div>\\n                <h3 style=\\\"margin:8px 0 6px\\\">Repairing energy and work-life balance</h3>\\n                <p class=\\\"price-note\\\">Assessment of demands, boundary work, and restorative practices to reduce overwhelm.</p>\\n              </div>\\n              <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Work-Life Reset</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"price-note\\\">Short or ongoing</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eef7f8,#f6fbfc);padding:18px;border-radius:12px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">How sessions are structured</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"price-note\\\">Initial assessment, goal-setting, and a plan with measurable steps. I use practical homework when helpful and adjust pace to your needs.</p>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <strong>Rates & options</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"price-note\\\">I offer single sessions, short-term pathways (6-12 sessions), and ongoing work. Sliding scale and limited pro-bono slots may be available; please inquire.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Schedule a consult</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px;background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6f0f2\\\">\\n          <!-- Unique decorative pattern SVG for specialties page -->\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 160 80\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n            <rect width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"80\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"#eaf6f8\\\" />\\n            <g fill=\\\"#2d6a7a\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"28\\\" cy=\\\"24\\\" r=\\\"18\\\" />\\n              <circle cx=\\\"88\\\" cy=\\\"44\\\" r=\\\"26\\\" />\\n              <circle cx=\\\"138\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" />\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <strong>Note on limits</strong>\\n          <div>Therapy here is supportive and non-judgmental. I am not an emergency service; if you are in immediate danger, call local emergency services. Limits to confidentiality will be discussed in the first session.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Want a brief consultation?</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-note\\\">A 20-minute consult can help clarify fit and next steps.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book a consult</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Frequently asked (quick answers)</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <strong>Q: Do you do couples therapy?</strong>\\n        <div>A: Yes, I work with individuals and couples; intake determines whether I can meet your needs or offer a referral.</div>\\n        <strong style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Q: How long before I see change?</strong>\\n        <div>A: Change varies. Some report relief in a few sessions; deeper patterns take longer. We’ll set measurable goals together.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}} — {{LICENSE}} • Confidentiality applies; see full practice policies. This site does not offer crisis support. If you are in crisis, call emergency services.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>My Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Therapeutic approach by {{THERAPIST_NAME}}. Relational, trauma-informed, practical psychotherapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fbfbfb;--fg:#102225;--accent:#c47dff;--muted:#607074;--card:#ffffff}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:960px;margin:40px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:14px}\\n    h1{font-size:34px;margin:6px 0}\\n    .columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:24px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .step{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fcf8ff);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n    .process{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .blockquote{border-left:4px solid #eee;padding-left:12px;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic}\\n    footer{margin-top:30px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">Thoughtful, steady therapy in {{CITY}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Who I Am</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Services</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Approach</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">FAQ</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"columns\\\">\\n      <section>\\n        <h1>How I work: a gentle, practical framework</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"small\\\">My approach is relational and trauma-informed. I aim to help you feel safer in your body, clearer about priorities, and more able to take manageable steps toward what matters.</p>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"process\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n            <strong>1. Clarify & stabilize</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">We begin with a focused assessment, identify immediate concerns, and build skills for regulation so you can engage with difficult material more safely.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n            <strong>2. Explore patterns</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">We gently map relational and emotional patterns. Insight is paired with experiments you can practice between sessions.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n            <strong>3. Practice change</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">I offer concrete tools (behavioral experiments, communication skills, grounding practices) and help tailor them to your life context.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n            <strong>4. Consolidate & plan</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">As goals shift, we create a plan for maintenance and next steps, including referrals when other supports are appropriate.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Therapeutic methods I integrate</h3>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Trauma-informed care and nervous system stabilization</li>\\n            <li>Cognitive-behavioral techniques and behavioral activation</li>\\n            <li>Attachment- and relationally-focused interventions</li>\\n            <li>Mindfulness, self-compassion, and values-oriented strategies</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Who finds this approach helpful?</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">People seeking practical change with compassionate support\\u2014those recovering from burnout, navigating transitions, healing from relational wounds, or wanting to manage anxiety in daily life.</p>\\n        </section>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">A client's voice</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"blockquote\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\\"I felt seen and given doable steps. I learned to notice my triggers and to experiment with new responses.\\\"</div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <strong>First step</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin:6px 0\\\">A 20-minute consultation helps us check fit and priorities. No pressure, just clarity.</p>\\n            <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f8f2ff);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #f0e6ff\\\">\\n          <!-- Unique approach page hero SVG (patterned wave) -->\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 120\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id=\\\"ag\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n                <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#c47dff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.18\\\" />\\n                <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6f3ab0\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.08\\\" />\\n              </linearGradient>\\n            </defs>\\n            <rect width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M0 60c40-40 80 40 140 18s60-58 200-20v62H0z\\\" fill=\\\"url(#ag)\\\" transform=\\\"translate(-60,-12)\\\" />\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <strong>Privacy & boundaries</strong>\\n          <div>All work is confidential with legal exceptions (e.g., imminent risk, child or elder abuse). I will review limits to confidentiality before care begins.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Common questions about how I work</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <strong>Q: What if I\\u2019m not ready to talk about trauma?</strong>\\n        <div>I respect pacing. We prioritize stabilization and safety first; deeper exploration only proceeds when you feel ready and have tools for regulation.</div>\\n\\n        <strong style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Q: Do you assign homework?</strong>\\n        <div>Occasionally: small experiments or reflections tailored to what you want and can reasonably try between sessions.</div>\\n\\n        <strong style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Q: Will you diagnose me?</strong>\\n        <div>Assessment may include diagnostic impressions when clinically relevant, but my focus is on functional changes and meaningful goals rather than labels alone.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0\\\">Interested in starting?</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">A brief consult can clarify fit and next steps.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Schedule a consult</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}} — {{LICENSE}} • {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • For emergencies call local emergency services. This site and communication do not replace crisis support or immediate medical care.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
